{"id":"n67316-1-3","stage":1,"title":"얼마나 · 多么","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67316-1-3-1","ko":"이것 봐. 이렇게 꾸미니까 얼마나 예쁘니?","zh":"快看。这么打扮一下，多漂亮啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"꾸미니까","meaning":"装饰，装扮","explanation":"꾸미다：装饰，装扮；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"꾸미다","audio":"/audio/c5ea965384e83ecff041.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62280","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸미다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꾸미니까","audio":"/audio/cf00b4ceb4d3d01bca65.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘니?","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘니","audio":"/audio/260ab9c2f5dae8c9c839.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c5ea965384e83ecf","term":"꾸미다","zh":"装饰，装扮","audio":"/audio/c5ea965384e83ecff041.mp3","entryId":"62280","definition":"修饰以使样子变好。","pronunciation":["꾸미다"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd95d9cbf69bf161afdc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67316-1-3-2","ko":"고마워. 내가 봐도 정말 놀랍다.","zh":"谢谢。就连我看了都觉得非常惊讶。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워","audio":"/audio/e9e8361d4662874097d3.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐도","audio":"/audio/fdd01bd86a193dbd13e5.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랍다.","meaning":"惊讶，意外","explanation":"놀랍다：惊讶，意外；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"놀랍다","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88324","senseId":"2","lemma":"놀랍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀랍다","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，看待","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"认识并判断事件或情况。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"8889c7d331879f69","term":"놀랍다","zh":"惊讶，意外","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3","entryId":"88324","definition":"感到很突然或很意外，因而处于害怕或兴奋的状态。","pronunciation":["놀ː랍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/95a1274b17f9270c51d3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67316","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6283,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["快看。这么打扮一下，多漂亮啊？","谢谢。就连我看了都觉得非常惊讶。","书是放在桌子上的对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["快看。这么打扮一下，多漂亮啊？","谢谢。就连我看了都觉得非常惊讶。","书是放在桌子上的对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
